AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
 BE GOORO KAFAN RAN MEIN HAI SHABBIR KA LASHA<br>
 ZEHRA KE JIGAR BAND KA SAR HAI SAR-E-NAIZA<br>
<br>
MAZLOOM KE LASHE PE JAFAKAAR DARINDE DAUDATE HAIN GHOODE,<br>
 PAMAALE SITAM HOTA HAI AHMED KANAWASA AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
<br>
RONE KI SADA AATI HAI MAQTAL KI FIZA SE AUR ARZO SAMA SE,<br>
 SHABBIR KE LASHE PE FUGHAAN KARTI HAI ZEHRA AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
<br>
BALWE ME KHULE SAR HAI KHADI DUKHTAR E HAIDER SAB AALE PAYAMBER,<br>
 SEHTI HAI SITAM RANJ O ALAM SAANIYE ZEHRA AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
<br>
SHERANE ALI LADTE HUE FAUJ E JAFA SE MAARE GAYE PYAASE,<br>
 AUR QAID MEIN SAHIL KE TADAPTA RAHA DARIYA AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
<br>
BAAZO BHI KATE MASHQ CHIDI MARGAYA SAQA PYAASI HAI SAKINA,<br>
 GHAZI KA BADAN KAANP RAHA HAI LABE DARIYA AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
<br>
IS HAAL ME BHI SHUKRE KHUDA LAB PA HAI PAIHAM LARZA HAI DO AALAM,<br>
 JALTI HUI RETI PA WO BEEMAR KA SAJDA AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
<br>
MARKER BHI SUKOON PA NA SAKA QABAR ME ASGHAR BANO KA DILBAR,<br>
 TURBAT SE NIKALA GAYA MASOOM KA LAASHA AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
<br>
ASBAAB LUTA JATA HAI AUR JALTE HAI QAIME HAR SIMT HAI SHOLAY,<br>
 QAIDIYE SITAM HOTA SHABBIR KA KUNBA AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
<br>
BE GOAR HAI MAIDAN MEIN BIKHRE HUE LAASHE SAB AHLE WAFA KE,<br>
 MAQTAL KI FIZA KARTI HAI MAZLOOMO PA GRIYA AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
<br>
AHSAAN SHAHEEDO KE HAI BHUDHE HO KE KAMSEEN HAI DEEN KE MOHSIN,<br>
 KAABE KE NIGHEBAANO KA GHAR LUT GAYA SARA AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
<br>
PAMAAL HUA RAN MEIN UDHAR QASIM E MUZTAR LAQTE DIL E SHABBAR,<br>
 BEWA HUI EK SHAB KI DULHAN FATIMA KUBRA AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
<br>
LIPTA HUA SHOLON SE HAI BEEMAR KA BISTAR GHASH ABID E MUZTAR,<br>
 MAA DEKHTI HAI JALTA HAI BESHEER KA JHOOLA AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN<br>
<br>
HAR DAUR MEIN MATAM SHEH E BEKAS KA HUA HAI ROKE NA ROKA HAI,<br>
 AWAAZ HAI MAZLOOM KI JAWEED KA NAUHA HAI AYE SHAAM-E-GAREEBAAN